   316	  This is the weakest baseline (it ignores budget awareness and keeps
   317	  exploiting locally even at low remaining budget).
   318	
   319	**Two findings that sharpen the claim**:
   320	
   321	1. **Lower one-step regret than the real state-conditional RulePolicy on 3/5 BOCoDe families**, including the
