   353	> one-step regret than the real state-conditional RulePolicy on three of
   354	> five tested family–dimension combinations** (Branin, Ackley, Rastrigin;
   355	> seed-block 95% CI upper bound < 0). The cross-family RF also has lower
   356	> regret than AlwaysSurrogate on the two 10D multimodal families (Ackley,
   357	> Rastrigin). It does **not** beat the constant `local_exploitation`
   358	> policy (AlwaysLocal) on aggregate, but that constant policy is
   359	> unrealistic — it does not respond to budget. We conclude that **a learned
   360	> System-1 transfers usefully across related BOCoDe families**, but the
